/* 首次使用说明：长说明保留完整英文键，确保系统切回英文时不受影响。 */
"Finish setup" = "完成设置";
"A pairing record is in place" = "已找到配对记录";
"No pairing record yet" = "尚无配对记录";
"If the tunnel was connected after the app had already started, close and reopen GoldenNugget once — it decides whether to start its own emulated tunnel at launch, and that decision is made once." = "如果是在 GoldenNugget 启动后才连接通道，请关闭并重新打开应用。是否启动模拟通道的判断只会在启动时执行一次。";
"Install LocalDevVPN (or any equivalent tunnel app) on this iPhone, then switch it on and enter the values above: the tunnel IP is this device's own address in the tunnel, and the peer is the other end. Leave the tunnel on — GoldenNugget needs it for every connection, and this app cannot install a VPN app or a configuration profile itself." = "请在这台 iPhone 上安装 LocalDevVPN（或同类通道应用），启用后填写上方参数：通道 IP 是本设备在通道内的地址，对端 IP 是通道另一端的地址。请保持通道开启；GoldenNugget 每次连接都需要它，且无法自行安装 VPN 应用或配置描述文件。";
"Custom tunnel values are in use (see Tunnel settings on the home page). These must match the ones in LocalDevVPN." = "正在使用自定义通道参数（见首页的通道设置），必须与 LocalDevVPN 中填写的参数一致。";
"To pair with a computer: connect this iPhone over USB, tap Trust when it asks, and run the computer's pairing tool against it — for example idevicepair from libimobiledevice, or Sideloadly. The tool writes a .mobiledevicepairing file; send that file to this phone (AirDrop, or save it in iCloud Drive) and import it above." = "使用电脑配对：通过 USB 连接这台 iPhone，出现提示时点击“信任”，然后在电脑上运行配对工具，例如 libimobiledevice 的 idevicepair 或 Sideloadly。工具会生成 .mobiledevicepairing 文件，将其传回手机（例如使用隔空投送或 iCloud 云盘），再从上方导入。";
"Or pair without a computer: iOS 27 lets the phone pair with itself, which is what the second button does. That record is this app's own — a computer still needs its own record, imported the first way." = "也可以不用电脑：iOS 27 允许设备与自身配对，第二个按钮就是执行该操作。生成的记录仅供本应用使用；电脑仍需要通过第一种方式获取自己的配对记录。";
"Both are ready. Finishing connects to the device and opens the home page; the record here is the one it reads." = "两项准备均已完成。点击完成后将连接设备并打开首页，使用的就是当前配对记录。";
"The tunnel and the pairing record are both required. Finish stays greyed out until both are ready — a home page that cannot connect is the state this guide exists to prevent." = "必须同时准备好通道和配对记录，完成按钮才会解锁。这样可以避免进入首页后却无法连接设备。";
"Skipping is not a dead end: this guide is in Settings afterwards." = "跳过后仍可在“设置”中重新打开此向导。";
"Finishing also starts copying this device's photos and videos into the app's container. It runs in the background — you can keep using the app — and the copy is what the “Restore media” button on the home page puts back after a reset. Videos take a while the first time; later launches only collect new files." = "完成设置后，还会开始将本设备的照片与视频复制到应用容器中。复制在后台进行，可以继续使用应用；首页的“恢复媒体文件”会在重置后将这些备份写回设备。首次复制视频可能较慢，之后只会增量收集新文件。";
"Not 0…32 — LocalDevVPN's tunnel-IP field takes a CIDR, and this is the part after the slash." = "数值必须为 0～32。LocalDevVPN 的通道 IP 使用 CIDR 格式，此处填写斜杠后的前缀长度。";
